  "details": "1. With a VRChat plus subscription, click on the camera tab in the quick menu and open the drone. \n\n2. Notice The four propellers on the drone model are clockwise-rotating in their animation (see gif), and the prop pitch is incorrectly mirrored (see in static image).\n\nDiagonally opposing propellers should have the same rotations. Neighboring propellers should have opposite rotations. Note the real-world example also attached.\n\nOverall a great addition in the current build! Love the long-range freedom!",
